{"id":"wb-5-486","name":"西泠印社","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西泠印社","text":"西泠（líng）印社，位于中华人民共和国浙江省杭州市西湖区孤山路31号西泠桥旁，是中国研究金石篆刻的一个百年学术团体，有“天下第一名社”之称，今为全国重点文物保护单位。西泠印社的金石篆刻技艺是国家级非物质文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%B3%A0%E5%8D%B0%E7%A4%BE","revisionId":93925738,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93925738","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f53a8852c0d119d1a53013b7.jpg","title":"西泠印社紀念社門.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A5%BF%E6%B3%A0%E5%8D%B0%E7%A4%BE%E7%B4%80%E5%BF%B5%E7%A4%BE%E9%96%80.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/%E8%A5%BF%E6%B3%A0%E5%8D%B0%E7%A4%BE%E7%B4%80%E5%BF%B5%E7%A4%BE%E9%96%80.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Inhorw","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西泠印社建社廿週年紀念社門，建於1923年。兩側題字為“石藏東漢名三老，社結西泠紀廿年。”","width":320,"height":427}}